{"seq":1,"slug":"digital-vat-oss-ioss","title":"数字商品 B2C 增值税与 OSS/IOSS","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/cross-border-digital-goods-delivery/digital-tax-region/digital-vat-oss-ioss","wordCount":1915,"readingTime":8,"html":"<h1 id=\"数字商品-b2c-增值税与-oss-ioss\">数字商品 B2C 增值税与 OSS/IOSS</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>数字服务增值税的基本规则是<strong>目的地原则</strong>：向非纳税义务人（B2C）提供的电子服务，在<strong>客户所在地</strong>课税。这一条在欧盟法律里的落点是增值税指令（Directive 2006/112/EC）第 58 条对电子服务的特别规定，配套的实施条例（Implementing Regulation (EU) No 282/2011）第 24b 与 24f 条给出了「客户在哪」的可执行推定规则（见 <a href=\"https://eur-lex.europa.eu/legal-content/EN/TXT/HTML/?uri=CELEX:02011R0282-20250414\">EUR-Lex 02011R0282 合并版</a>）。</p>\n<p>对一个卖家来说，这条规则展开成三个必须回答的问题：<strong>按哪个国家的税率</strong>、<strong>向哪个税务机关申报</strong>、<strong>用什么证据支撑这个判定</strong>。第三个问题归 <a href=\"../digital-tax-region/buyer-location-determine\">买家所在地判定证据</a>，前两个由本文处理。</p>\n<p>欧盟为此提供了两个一站式申报机制，名字相近但管的完全是两类东西：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>机制</th>\n<th>管的供给</th>\n<th>是否适用数字商品</th>\n<th>申报频率</th>\n<th>注册国</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Union OSS（欧盟内）</td>\n<td>欧盟内跨境 B2C 服务 + 欧盟内货物远程销售</td>\n<td>是（服务部分）</td>\n<td>每季度</td>\n<td>一个成员国</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Non-Union OSS</td>\n<td>非欧盟卖家向欧盟消费者的 B2C 服务</td>\n<td>是</td>\n<td>每季度</td>\n<td>一个成员国</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>IOSS</td>\n<td>€150 以下的进口货物远程销售</td>\n<td>否</td>\n<td>每月</td>\n<td>一个成员国</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>本国申报</td>\n<td>未触发跨境规则的供给</td>\n<td>是</td>\n<td>按本国规定</td>\n<td>本国</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>欧盟官方对 OSS 的描述是：卖家在「单一成员国」注册，VAT 在该国申报并缴纳，再由该国转交给消费发生国；三个 scheme 是可选的，但一旦选用即<strong>全有或全无</strong>——必须对该国所有符合条件的三类供给统一适用（见 <a href=\"https://vat-one-stop-shop.ec.europa.eu/one-stop-shop_en\">EU VAT One Stop Shop</a>）。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  A[B2C 电子服务供给] --&gt; B{卖家是否在欧盟设立?}&#10;  B --&gt;|是| C[Union OSS]&#10;  B --&gt;|否| D[Non-Union OSS]&#10;  A --&gt; E{年跨境 TBE 总额}&#10;  E --&gt;|&lt;= 10000 EUR 且单一设立国| F[可按本国税率在设立国课税]&#10;  E --&gt;|超出| C&#10;  C --&gt; G[季度申报&lt;br/&gt;按消费国税率拆分]&#10;  G --&gt; H[注册国代收代缴]&#10;  I[€150 以下进口货物] --&gt; J[IOSS&lt;br/&gt;月度申报]&#10;  F --&gt; K{卖家是否主动选择&lt;br/&gt;一般规则?}&#10;  K --&gt;|是| C\">graph TD\n  A[B2C 电子服务供给] --&gt; B{卖家是否在欧盟设立?}\n  B --&gt;|是| C[Union OSS]\n  B --&gt;|否| D[Non-Union OSS]\n  A --&gt; E{年跨境 TBE 总额}\n  E --&gt;|&lt;= 10000 EUR 且单一设立国| F[可按本国税率在设立国课税]\n  E --&gt;|超出| C\n  C --&gt; G[季度申报&lt;br/&gt;按消费国税率拆分]\n  G --&gt; H[注册国代收代缴]\n  I[€150 以下进口货物] --&gt; J[IOSS&lt;br/&gt;月度申报]\n  F --&gt; K{卖家是否主动选择&lt;br/&gt;一般规则?}\n  K --&gt;|是| C</pre><h2 id=\"10-000-阈值与它的绑定效应\">€10,000 阈值与它的绑定效应</h2><h3 id=\"阈值怎么算\">阈值怎么算</h3><p>欧盟规则里有一个年度 <strong>€10,000</strong> 的跨境营业额阈值，它同时覆盖两类供给：面向消费者的跨境 TBE 服务（电信、广播、电子服务），以及欧盟内的货物远程销售，两者按不含税额<strong>合并计算</strong>。适用条件是卖家仅在<strong>一个</strong>成员国设立（或居住），且当年与上一年度的合并金额都不超过 €10,000。低于阈值时，TBE 服务的 VAT 可以继续在卖家设立国缴纳，即这些供给被当作本国供给，<strong>不能</strong>通过 Union OSS 申报（见 <a href=\"https://vat-one-stop-shop.ec.europa.eu/one-stop-shop_en\">EU VAT One Stop Shop</a>）。</p>\n<h3 id=\"阈值对系统的两个约束\">阈值对系统的两个约束</h3><p>第一，阈值判定是<strong>按年滚动</strong>的，且一旦当年中途超限，从超限那一刻起一般规则立即适用，不再等年度结束。这意味着系统必须在每笔跨境订单后更新累计额，并在跨过阈值时<strong>当场切换计税口径</strong>——不是下个月、不是下个季度。工程上要把「累计跨境额」做成一个事务内更新的计数，并在超限时给订单打上「口径已切换」的标记。</p>\n<p>第二，卖家可以主动放弃阈值、直接适用一般规则，但一旦这样选择就会被<strong>绑定两个日历年</strong>。这个约束要在后台做成显式的开关并记录选择时间，因为「反悔」在合规上是不被允许的，系统需要能证明选择的起点。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>状态</th>\n<th>计税地</th>\n<th>可否走 OSS</th>\n<th>切换后果</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>阈值内（默认）</td>\n<td>卖家设立国</td>\n<td>否</td>\n<td>无需切换</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>阈值内（主动选择一般规则）</td>\n<td>消费者所在地</td>\n<td>是</td>\n<td>绑定 2 个日历年</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>已超阈值</td>\n<td>消费者所在地</td>\n<td>是</td>\n<td>立即生效，不可逆回</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"税率与减税率\">税率与减税率</h2><h3 id=\"电子出版物的减税率\">电子出版物的减税率</h3><p>历史上欧盟成员国可以对<strong>有形介质</strong>上的出版物（书、报纸、期刊）适用减税率，但电子方式提供的出版物只能适用标准税率。理事会指令 (EU) 2018/1713 修改了增值税指令，允许成员国把电子提供出版物的税率<strong>对齐</strong>到有形出版物的低税率（见 <a href=\"https://eur-lex.europa.eu/legal-content/EN/TXT/HTML/?uri=CELEX:32018L1713\">EUR-Lex 32018L1713</a>）。这条修正对数字商品平台的直接影响是：电子书、电子报刊这类 SKU 的税率<strong>不再统一按标准税率</strong>，必须按消费国的具体规定取值，且同一商品在不同国家的适用税率可能不同。</p>\n<h3 id=\"税率表必须按国家-品类维护\">税率表必须按国家 × 品类维护</h3><p>税率不是常量。系统需要一张按「消费国 × 商品税类」索引的税率表，并带生效日期，因为税率会变动且变动通常有明确的生效日：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"CREATE TABLE vat_rate (&#10;  country      CHAR(2) NOT NULL,&#10;  tax_class    TEXT    NOT NULL,   -- &#39;standard&#39; | &#39;ebook&#39; | &#39;enewspaper&#39; | ...&#10;  rate_bp      INT     NOT NULL,   -- 基点表示: 1900 = 19.00%&#10;  effective_from DATE   NOT NULL,&#10;  effective_to   DATE,&#10;  source_ref   TEXT     NOT NULL,  -- 法规或税务机关公告的引用&#10;  PRIMARY KEY (country, tax_class, effective_from)&#10;);\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> TABLE</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> vat_rate</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  country      </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CHAR</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  tax_class    </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,   </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 'standard' | 'ebook' | 'enewspaper' | ...</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  rate_bp      </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">INT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">     NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,   </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 基点表示: 1900 = 19.00%</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  effective_from </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">DATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">   NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  effective_to   </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">DATE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  source_ref   </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">     NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,  </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 法规或税务机关公告的引用</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  PRIMARY KEY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (country, tax_class, effective_from)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span></code></pre></div><p>用<strong>基点整数</strong>（basis point）而不是浮点数存税率是必须的：<code>0.19</code> 这类浮点数在乘算时会产生分位误差，跨境场景下百万笔订单累积起来就是实质的账目差异。所有金额计算用整数最小货币单位，税率用整数基点，最后一步才做四舍五入。</p>\n<p>税的计算本身是：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>T</mi><mo>=</mo><mtext>round</mtext><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><mfrac><mrow><msub><mi>P</mi><mrow><mi>n</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub><mo>⋅</mo><mi>r</mi></mrow><mn>10000</mn></mfrac><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"2em\"/><msub><mi>P</mi><mrow><mi>g</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>s</mi><mi>s</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>P</mi><mrow><mi>n</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub><mo>+</mo><mi>T</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T = \\text{round}\\left(\\frac{P_{net} \\cdot r}{10000}\\right), \\qquad P_{gross} = P_{net} + T</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.4em;vertical-align:-0.95em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">round</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size3\">(</span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">10000</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size3\">)</span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:2em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">oss</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>r</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">r</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span></span></span></span></span> 是以基点表示的税率，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>P</mi><mrow><mi>n</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P_{net}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是不含税价。如果平台以含税价展示（欧盟 B2C 的通行做法），则要反解：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>P</mi><mrow><mi>n</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mtext>round</mtext><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><mfrac><mrow><msub><mi>P</mi><mrow><mi>g</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>s</mi><mi>s</mi></mrow></msub><mo>⋅</mo><mn>10000</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>10000</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>r</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P_{net} = \\text{round}\\left(\\frac{P_{gross} \\cdot 10000}{10000 + r}\\right)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.8em;vertical-align:-0.65em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">round</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size2\">(</span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9857em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.655em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">10000</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">+</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.5073em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1645em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.357em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.0714em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.5em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size3 size1 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">oss</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2819em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">⋅</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">10000</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.4033em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size2\">)</span></span></span></span></span></span></span>。反解与正解在分位上<strong>不互逆</strong>，这是一个必须显式决策的点——退款时用哪个方向计算，决定了买家看到的退款额与平台账上的冲销额是否一致。</p>\n<h2 id=\"oss-申报的数据要求\">OSS 申报的数据要求</h2><h3 id=\"申报按消费国拆分\">申报按消费国拆分</h3><p>OSS 申报的核心是一张按<strong>消费国 × 税率</strong>聚合的表，而不是按订单明细。这意味着系统必须能对任意一个季度、任意一个国家，给出「应税基数 + 税额」两个数：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"SELECT o.consumer_country,&#10;       o.tax_class,&#10;       o.vat_rate_bp,&#10;       sum(o.taxable_base_minor) AS base_minor,&#10;       sum(o.vat_amount_minor)   AS vat_minor,&#10;       count(*)                  AS txn_count&#10;  FROM order_tax_line o&#10; WHERE o.supply_date &gt;= $1 AND o.supply_date &lt; $2&#10;   AND o.scheme = &#39;union_oss&#39;&#10; GROUP BY o.consumer_country, o.tax_class, o.vat_rate_bp&#10; ORDER BY o.consumer_country, o.tax_class;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> o</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">consumer_country</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">       o</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">tax_class</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">       o</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">vat_rate_bp</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">       sum</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">o</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">taxable_base_minor</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> base_minor,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">       sum</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">o</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">vat_amount_minor</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)   </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> vat_minor,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">       count</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)                  </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> txn_count</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> order_tax_line o</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> o</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">supply_date</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> >=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> $</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> AND</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> o</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">supply_date</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> $</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">   AND</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> o</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">scheme</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'union_oss'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> GROUP BY</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> o</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">consumer_country</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">o</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">tax_class</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">o</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">vat_rate_bp</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> ORDER BY</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> o</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">consumer_country</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">o</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">tax_class</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"三个容易漏掉的字段\">三个容易漏掉的字段</h3><p><strong>供给日期与税率确定日</strong>。税率应在<strong>应税事件发生时</strong>确定（增值税指令第 25 条要求只考虑应税事件发生时的情形）。系统需要同时存 <code>supply_date</code>（用于归属申报期）和 <code>rate_effective_date</code>（用于证明用的是哪一版税率），两者在跨税率变更的订单里会不一致。</p>\n<p><strong>币种与折算</strong>。订单可能是美元、日元，但申报要用注册国货币。折算汇率必须来自一个有出处且可复现的来源，并记录汇率取值日。用「当时随手查的汇率」会导致无法复现申报数字。</p>\n<p><strong>退款与冲销</strong>。跨境退款退的是含税金额，但<strong>已申报并缴纳的税不会自动退回</strong>，需要通过后续申报期的调整项（负向调整）收回。因此订单税行必须有独立的冲销记录，而不是把原行改掉：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"json\" data-code=\"{&#10;  &quot;order_tax_line_id&quot;: &quot;tl_55012&quot;,&#10;  &quot;order_id&quot;: &quot;o_990231&quot;,&#10;  &quot;consumer_country&quot;: &quot;SE&quot;,&#10;  &quot;tax_class&quot;: &quot;standard&quot;,&#10;  &quot;vat_rate_bp&quot;: 2500,&#10;  &quot;taxable_base_minor&quot;: 79920,&#10;  &quot;vat_amount_minor&quot;: 19980,&#10;  &quot;currency&quot;: &quot;SEK&quot;,&#10;  &quot;supply_date&quot;: &quot;2026-07-14&quot;,&#10;  &quot;rate_effective_date&quot;: &quot;2026-07-01&quot;,&#10;  &quot;scheme&quot;: &quot;union_oss&quot;,&#10;  &quot;fx_rate&quot;: { &quot;from&quot;: &quot;EUR&quot;, &quot;to&quot;: &quot;SEK&quot;, &quot;rate_bp&quot;: 112340, &quot;as_of&quot;: &quot;2026-07-14&quot; },&#10;  &quot;adjustments&quot;: [{ &quot;type&quot;: &quot;refund_reversal&quot;, &quot;period&quot;: &quot;2026Q4&quot;, &quot;base_minor&quot;: -79920, &quot;vat_minor&quot;: -19980 }]&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"order_tax_line_id\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"tl_55012\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"order_id\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"o_990231\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"consumer_country\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"SE\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"tax_class\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"standard\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"vat_rate_bp\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2500</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"taxable_base_minor\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">79920</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"vat_amount_minor\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">19980</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"currency\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"SEK\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"supply_date\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"2026-07-14\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"rate_effective_date\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"2026-07-01\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"scheme\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"union_oss\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"fx_rate\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"from\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"EUR\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"to\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"SEK\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"rate_bp\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">112340</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"as_of\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"2026-07-14\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"adjustments\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [{ </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"type\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"refund_reversal\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"period\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"2026Q4\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"base_minor\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">-79920</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"vat_minor\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">-19980</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>数字服务 B2C 按目的地原则在客户所在地课税；实施条例第 24b/24f 条给出客户位置的推定与证据规则。</li>\n<li>OSS 与 IOSS 是两套机制：OSS 管欧盟内跨境服务与货物远程销售（季度申报），IOSS 管 €150 以下进口货物（月度申报），数字商品只走 OSS。</li>\n<li>€10,000 年度阈值合并计算跨境 TBE 服务与欧盟内货物远程销售；超限当刻起立即切换到一般规则；主动放弃阈值会被绑定两个日历年。</li>\n<li>电子出版物可适用减税率（指令 2018/1713），因此税率表必须按消费国 × 税类维护，用整数基点存储并带生效日期。</li>\n<li>申报按消费国 × 税率聚合，需保留供给日期、税率确定日、可复现的汇率与来源；退款用独立调整行冲销，不改历史税行。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"数字商品 B2C 增值税与 OSS/IOSS","id":"数字商品-b2c-增值税与-oss-ioss"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"€10,000 阈值与它的绑定效应","id":"10-000-阈值与它的绑定效应"},{"level":3,"text":"阈值怎么算","id":"阈值怎么算"},{"level":3,"text":"阈值对系统的两个约束","id":"阈值对系统的两个约束"},{"level":2,"text":"税率与减税率","id":"税率与减税率"},{"level":3,"text":"电子出版物的减税率","id":"电子出版物的减税率"},{"level":3,"text":"税率表必须按国家 × 品类维护","id":"税率表必须按国家-品类维护"},{"level":2,"text":"OSS 申报的数据要求","id":"oss-申报的数据要求"},{"level":3,"text":"申报按消费国拆分","id":"申报按消费国拆分"},{"level":3,"text":"三个容易漏掉的字段","id":"三个容易漏掉的字段"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"兑换/激活与授权绑定流程","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/cross-border-digital-goods-delivery/instant-fulfillment/license-redemption-flow"},"next":{"title":"买家所在地判定证据","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/cross-border-digital-goods-delivery/digital-tax-region/buyer-location-determine"}}